# Repo-root Docker context for minion/Dockerfile (F-007). The build only needs minion/
# (pyproject, uv.lock, README, src, .claude/commands) and shared/ (pyproject + generated
# veilleur_shared). Keep the context small — exclude everything heavy or irrelevant.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate*
.git
.github
pwa
trigger-api
infra
functions
specs
docs
*.md
.env
.env.*
# minion/README.md is the project `readme` and is COPY'd in the builder stage. (`*.md` only matches
# top-level files in Docker's matcher, so nested READMEs aren't excluded — kept explicit for clarity.)
!minion/README.md
# The vendored /generate command must reach the context (copied into the image).
!minion/.claude/commands/generate.md
